+# Plan — classic MSTest suite for fixtures/classic-mstest
+
+## New test files (registered once each in Discounts.Tests.csproj)
+- DiscountServiceBoundaryTests.cs (FixtureBase<DiscountService> + Moq + NBuilder):
+  100% discount returns zero; 25% off 200 returns exactly 150; negative and
+  above-100 percentages throw ArgumentOutOfRangeException; a missing product
+  throws InvalidOperationException.
+- TieredDiscountPolicyTests.cs (direct construction):
+  non-positive threshold and out-of-range rate throw in the constructor; negative
+  subtotal throws; below-threshold returns the subtotal unchanged; exact-threshold
+  applies the discount (100 -> 90 at 10%); above-threshold returns 200 -> 180.
+
+## Acceptance mapping
+Every named DiscountService and TieredDiscountPolicy behavior maps to one test with
+a concrete expected value. Exception assertions use Assert.ThrowsException<T> only.
+
+## Quality review
+Cases are nonredundant boundary/behavior checks. The classic stack, project format,
+pinned versions, and the existing test file are left untouched.
