+# Research — classic MSTest suite for fixtures/classic-mstest
+
+## Stack (must be preserved, not modernized)
+- net472 test project (Discounts.Tests.csproj), MSBuild 15.0 format, packages.config.
+- MSTest.TestFramework/TestAdapter 3.5.2, Moq 4.2.1510.2205, NBuilder 6.1.0.
+- Tests derive from FixtureBase<TSut> (a [TestInitialize] base that builds Sut).
+- Explicit <Compile Include> items — each new test file must be registered by hand.
+
+## Production surface under test
+- DiscountService.Apply(productId, percentage): validates 0..100, throws
+  ArgumentOutOfRangeException outside that range; looks the product up through
+  IProductRepository and throws InvalidOperationException when it is missing;
+  otherwise returns price * (1 - percentage/100).
+- TieredDiscountPolicy(threshold, rate): threshold must be > 0 and rate in 0..1,
+  else ArgumentOutOfRangeException. Apply(subtotal): negative subtotal throws;
+  below threshold returns the subtotal unchanged; at/above threshold applies rate.
+
+## Constraints
+- MSTest 3.5.2 exposes Assert.ThrowsException<T>; it has neither Assert.Throws<T>
+  nor Assert.ThrowsExactly<T>, so exception paths must use Assert.ThrowsException<T>.
+- DiscountServiceTests.cs and packages.config stay byte-for-byte unchanged.
\ No newline at end of file
